es you feel like  you're on the right Avenue no I thought  if we had a suspect I would put that out  to the public has the case gone cold no  it hasn't gone cold we're all  1,400 tips we continue to get tips in as  we speak it might take time but you're  optimistic we will bring Jaime home the  sheriff is going to hold a briefing  later today where he's expected to talk  about some of those items that were  found but as of yesterday none was  connected to this disappearance the  funerals for James and Denise cloths  Jamie's parents are this Saturday viana  we're thinking of everyone there in  Barron County that community really  coming together in this search Don thank  you
 

